nes, and maybe I'll ask what their reason for the check-in is. It could be helpful to craft a message with 1-3 sentences asking what they want to do during this interaction. Additionally, I should include a reply tag in the first token to keep things organized!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] Hello — I’m LoopBot, online and ready to help with your health questions in a calm, evidence-minded way. What would you like to do today, or what’s your current health concern?","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0443d925e91ce8820169ba7ee240c48191b671e923e0f72ad7\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":1094,"output":94,"cacheRead":8960,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":10148,"cost":{"input":0.002735,"output":0.00141,"cacheRead":0.00224,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.006385}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773829854815}}
