\"cec2be6f871d276b45d13e3010c788f01b03ae2f1caca3264bbf759afacace46\",\"text\":\"Telegram Bot\",\"translated\":\"Telegram 机器人\",\"provider\":\"pi\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-5\",\"src_lang\":\"en\",\"tgt_lang\":\"zh-CN\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-01T13:00:58Z\"}\n/app/docs/.i18n/zh-CN.tm.jsonl:642:{\"cache_key\":\"7d927444fcf26b06d31a6f1f5d134416f8539e3aa1cc8dd3a4a7c5819fd1534a\",\"segment_id\":\"index.md:f12242785ecda793\",\"source_path\":\"index.md\",\"text_hash\":\"f12242785ecda7935ded50cd48418357d32d3bac290f7a199bc9f0c7fbd13123\",\"text\":\") — Location parsing (Telegram + WhatsApp)\",\"translated\":\"）— 位置解析（Telegram + WhatsApp）\",\"provider\":\"pi\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-5\",\"src_lang\":\"en\",\"tgt_lang\":\"zh-CN\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-01T13:06:46Z\"}\n/app/docs/.i18n/zh-CN.tm.jsonl:678:{\"cache_key\":\"85cb0b7ed6991128b9fe65b7b103c5f32da742641cb24ffc1a3469002a2bcad6\",\"segment_id\":\"start/getting-started.md:e24d86fa815827a4\",\"source_path\":\"start/getting-started.md\",\"text_hash\":\"e24d86fa815827a4dc5b8b22711caaf036427796512a74167ebaf615c495f9f8\",\"text\":\"Telegram / Discord / others\",\"translated\":\"Telegram / Discord / 其他\",\"provider\":\"pi\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-5\",\"src_lang\":\"en\",\"tgt_lang\":\"zh-CN\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-01T13:37:17Z\"}\n/app/docs/.i18n/zh-CN.tm.jsonl:741:{\"cache_key\":\"93114bd8806e7d10e3c22b3415d23eec041357c24c8f6dc651d62cacc41ad375\",\"segment_id\":\"start/getting-started.md:69c1cae4e20f3b2b\",\"source_path\":\"start/getting-started.md\",\"text_hash\":\"69c1cae4e20f3b2b4d3b3dd3ea7636d8faed8460af512aa7a7d3a3c09696f5fc\",\"text\":\" Bun has known issues with these\\nchannels. If you use WhatsApp or Telegram, run the Gateway with \",\"translated\":\" Bun 在这些渠道上存在已知问题。如果您使用 WhatsApp 或 Telegram，请使用 \",\"provider\":\"pi\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-5\",\"src_lang\":\"en\",\"tgt_lang\":\"zh-CN\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-01T13:37:03Z\"}\n/app/docs/.i18n/zh-CN.tm.jsonl:747:{\"cache_key\":\"93f8819a09c973fae0ec648305d9c7e50ebee3771359b807686c605023b0b705\",\"segment_id\":\"start/getting-started.md:eba2ed5d6cc0239d\",\"source_path\":\"start/getting-started.md\",\"text_hash\":\"eba2ed5d6cc0239dd5d0475d7ea57b120ff06eb1100c67f4cf713c3bb167f0a0\",\"text\":\": Node (recommended; required for WhatsApp/Telegram). Bun is \",\"translated\":\"：Node（推荐；WhatsApp/Telegram 必需）。Bun 为 \",\"provider\":\"pi\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-5\",\"src_lang\":\"en\",\"tgt_lang\":\"zh-CN\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-01T13:36:19Z\"}\n/app/docs/.i18n/zh-CN.tm.jsonl:787:{\"cache_key\":\"9bb6f5ad39ff9d7aff3bca1fda6f474e19f25c0ffaaffaf3b19c924234d8c03a\",\"segment_id\":\"index.md:f0d82ba647b4a33d\",\"source_path\":\"index.md\",\"text_hash\":\"f0d82ba647b4a33da3008927253f9bed21e380f54eab0608b1136de4cbff1286\",\"text\":\"OpenClaw bridges WhatsApp (via WhatsApp Web / Baileys), Telegram (Bot API / grammY), Discord (Bot API / channels.discord.js), and iMessage (imsg CLI) to coding agents like \",\"translated\":\"OpenClaw 将 WhatsApp（通过 WhatsApp Web / Baileys）、Telegram（Bot API / grammY）、Discord（Bot API / 渠道.discord.js）和 iMessage（imsg CLI）桥接到编程 智能体，例如 \",\"provider\":\"pi\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-5\",\"src_lang\":\"en\",\"tgt_lang\":\"zh-CN\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-01T12:47:31Z\"}\n/app/docs/.i18n/zh-CN.tm.jsonl:826:{\"cache_key\":\"a2c462e51d228b070aba2a14a09d41aa54e0962d795724d5a090c71c7e242dfe\",\"segment_id\":\"start/getting-started.md:acdd1e734125f341\",\"source_path\":\"start/getting-started.md\",\"text_hash\":\"acdd1e734125f341604c0efbabdcc4c4b0597e8f6235d66c2445edd1812838c1\",\"text\":\"Telegram\",\"translated\":\"Telegram\",\"provider\":\"pi\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-5\",\"src_lang\":\"en\",\"tgt_lang\":\"zh-CN\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-01T13:37:22Z\"}\n/app/docs/.i18n/zh-CN.tm.jsonl:848:{\"cache_key\":\"a626e7fe04bc58aa97f7363efbdaa14d5804691b203594e954e7373d26bc5bbb\",\"segment_id\":\"start/getting-started.md:f68f6c2d3e9114cf\",\"source_path\":\"start/getting-started.md\",\"text_hash\":\"f68f6c2d3e9114cfec906d6a20cd048091e580c6e1d00a8066165dba188f9b3e\",\"text\":\"channels (WhatsApp/Telegram/Discord/Mattermost (plugin)/...)\",\"translated\":\"渠道（WhatsApp/Telegram/Discord/Mattermost（插件）/...）\",\"provider\":\"pi\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-5\",\"src_lang\":\"en\",\"tgt_lang\":\"zh-CN\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-01T13:34:56Z\"}\n/app/docs/.i18n/zh-CN.tm.jsonl:867:{\"cache_key\":\"aacffcbc2a97abf1a5eccd00e5893be1125e364251fa27f3e0c88ef2db2b0248\",\"segment_id\":\"index.md:acdd1e734125f341\",\"source_path\":\"index.md\",\"text_hash\":\"acdd1e734125f341604c0efbabdcc4c4b0597e8f6235d66c2445edd1812838c1\",\"text\":\"Telegram\",\"translated\":\"Telegram\",\"provider\":\"pi\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-5\",\"src_lang\":\"en\",\"tgt_lang\":\"zh-CN\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-01T13:32:36Z\"}\n/app/docs/.i18n/zh-CN.tm.jsonl:934:{\"cache_key\":\"b5687bd5a0443bd1ccaa45996bbe3a784f66fa059e4aa68048a14712f853d56e\",\"segment_id\":\"start/wizard.md:5f6a8991209034d4\",\"source_path\":\"start/wizard.md\",\"text_hash\":\"5f6a8991209034d4d6473c75e2f74dc3df90cc6cde2723d7d25085dbfc3fad24\",\"text\":\"Providers (Telegram, WhatsApp, Discord, Google Chat, Mattermost (plugin), Signal)\",\"translated\":\"提供商（Telegram、WhatsApp、Discord、Google Chat、Mattermost（插件）、Signal）\",\"provider\":\"pi\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-5\",\"src_lang\":\"en\",\"tgt_lang\":\"zh-CN\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-01T13:40:26Z\"}\n/app/docs/.i18n/zh-CN.tm.jsonl:946:{\"cache_key\":\"b7c642921d34922bbb25206e04a52428c8707414d90f0aa9bbc07366d3165e09\",\"segment_id\":\"start/getting-started.md:73526fff31f4fa0a\",\"source_path\":\"start/getting-started.md\",\"text_hash\":\"73526fff31f4fa0a98e4e135e0610652867bd8842a6abeb821e02ee87842bb96\",\"text\":\"Telegram DM tip:\",\"translated\":\"Telegram 私信提示：\",\"provider\":\"pi\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-5\",\"src_lang\":\"en\",\"tgt_lang\":\"zh-CN\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-01T13:37:33Z\"}\n/app/docs/.i18n/zh-CN.tm.jsonl:1010:{\"cache_key\":\"c3c32ca9a6e0b7331bd674903379664ef8c5ab9f675dbb531062af512452343e\",\"segment_id\":\"index.md:acdd1e734125f341\",\"source_path\":\"index.md\",\"text_hash\":\"acdd1e734125f341604c0efbabdcc4c4b0597e8f6235d66c2445edd1812838c1\",\"text\":\"Telegram\",\"translated\":\"Telegram\",\"provider\":\"pi\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-5\",\"src_lang\":\"en\",\"tgt_lang\":\"zh-CN\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-01T13:04:46Z\"}\n/app/docs/.i18n/zh-CN.tm.jsonl:1040:{\"cache_key\":\"c982edd40183708dbf5bc791228db4bfd5b4b33d5a623e1173ee48a697e31c6f\",\"segment_id\":\"index.md:f12242785ecda793\",\"source_path\":\"index.md\",\"text_hash\":\"f12242785ecda7935ded50cd48418357d32d3bac290f7a199bc9f0c7fbd13123\",\"text\":\") — Location parsing (Telegram + WhatsApp)\",\"translated\":\"）—— 位置解析（Telegram + WhatsApp）\",\"provider\":\"pi\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-5\",\"src_lang\":\"en\",\"tgt_lang\":\"zh-CN\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-01T12:54:56Z\"}\n/app/docs/.i18n/zh-CN.tm.jsonl:1148:{\"cache_key\":\"deab7aa2d56c6fe242f6f04eef414a3fed9e1ac64374fcba6ed245d7b2733f6b\",\"segment_id\":\"start/getting-started.md:e0626242c2ea510e\",\"source_path\":\"start/getting-started.md\",\"text_hash\":\"e0626242c2ea510e9457d6fb1b2848fe7091b10201c13d28c9774e6450ad28b2\",\"text\":\": WhatsApp QR login, Telegram/Discord bot tokens, Mattermost plugin tokens, etc.\",\"translated\":\"：WhatsApp 二维码登录、Telegram/Discord 机器人令牌、Mattermost 插件令牌等。\",\"provider\":\"pi\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-5\",\"src_lang\":\"en\",\"tgt_lang\":\"zh-CN\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-01T13:36:11Z\"}\n/app/docs/.i18n/zh-CN.tm.jsonl:1191:{\"cache_key\":\"e6e456289628d5a4b6cbbc0fbb263d656ba7d49427a2009ce3c5f608b8505ea0\",\"segment_id\":\"index.md:f0d82ba647b4a33d\",\"source_path\":\"index.md\",\"text_hash\":\"f0d82ba647b4a33da3008927253f9bed21e380f54eab0608b1136de4cbff1286\",\"text\":\"OpenClaw bridges WhatsApp (via WhatsApp Web / Baileys), Telegram (Bot API / grammY), Discord (Bot API / channels.discord.js), and iMessage (imsg CLI) to coding agents like \",\"translated\":\"OpenClaw 将 WhatsApp（通过 WhatsApp Web / Baileys）、Telegram（Bot API / grammY）、Discord（Bot API / channels.discord.js）和 iMessage（imsg CLI）桥接到编程 智能体，例如 \",\"provider\":\"pi\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-5\",\"src_lang\":\"en\",\"tgt_lang\":\"zh-CN\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-01T12:58:56Z\"}\n/app/docs/.i18n/zh-CN.tm.jsonl:1298:{\"cache_key\":\"faae749a1e3720731bd89450cc30ca39d65ca2d3968ac048373c3f6ba5087381\",\"segment_id\":\"start/getting-started.md:9c7c1a1750d380e8\",\"source_path\":\"start/getting-started.md\",\"text_hash\":\"9c7c1a1750d380e8b4f5329437dd3e6066f20891e74af700595ddf8a5eac42a3\",\"text\":\"Bun warning (WhatsApp + Telegram):\",\"translated\":\"Bun 警告（WhatsApp + Telegram）：\",\"provider\":\"pi\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-5\",\"src_lang\":\"en\",\"tgt_lang\":\"zh-CN\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-01T13:37:01Z\"}\n/app/docs/reference/test.md:13:- `pnpm test:coverage`: Runs the unit suite with V8 coverage (via `vitest.unit.config.ts`). Global thresholds are 70% lines/branches/functions/statements. Coverage excludes integration-heavy entrypoints (CLI wiring, gateway/telegram bridges, webchat static server) to keep the target focused on unit-testable logic.\n/app/docs/reference/wizard.md:90:    - [Telegram](/channels/telegram): bot token.\n/app/docs/reference/wizard.md:111:    - **Runtime selection:** Node (recommended; required for WhatsApp/Telegram). Bun is **not recommended**.\n/app/docs/reference/wizard.md:297:- `channels.telegram.botToken`, `channels.discord.token`, `channels.signal.*`, `channels.imessage.*`\n/app/docs/reference/wizard.md:319:- Providers: [WhatsApp](/channels/whatsapp), [Telegram](/channels/telegram), [Discord](/channels/discord), [Google Chat](/channels/googlechat), [Signal](/channels/signal), [BlueBubbles](/channels/bluebubbles) (iMessage), [iMessage](/channels/imessage) (legacy)\n/app/docs/reference/session-management-compaction.md:62:  - Telegram topic sessions: `.../<sessionId>-topic-<threadId>.jsonl`\n/app/docs/reference/secretref-user-supplied-credentials-matrix.json:332:      \"id\": \"channels.telegram.accounts.*.botToken\",\n/app/docs/reference/secretref-user-supplied-credentials-matrix.json:334:      \"path\": \"channels.telegram.accounts.*.botToken\",\n/app/docs/reference/secretref-user-supplied-credentials-matrix.json:339:      \"id\": \"channels.telegram.accounts.*.webhookSecret\",\n/app/docs/reference/secretref-user-supplied-credentials-matrix.json:341:      \"path\": \"channels.telegram.accounts.*.webhookSecret\",\n/app/docs/reference/secretref-user-supplied-credentials-matrix.json:346:      \"id\": \"channels.telegram.botToken\",\n/app/docs/reference/secretref-user-supplied-credentials-matrix.json:348:      \"path\": \"channels.telegram.botToken\",\n/app/docs/reference/secretref-user-supplied-credentials-matrix.json:353:      \"id\": \"channels.telegram.webhookSecret\",\n/app/docs/reference/secretref-user-supplied-credentials-matrix.json:355:      \"path\": \"channels.telegram.webhookSecret\",\n/app/docs/reference/token-use.md:35:- Attachments/transcripts (images, audio, files)"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":57,"aggregated":"/app/docs/nodes/audio.md:13:  1. Locates the first audio attachment (local path or URL) and downloads it if needed.\n/app/docs/nodes/audio.md:140:- Use `tools.media.audio.attachments` to process multiple voice notes (`mode: \"all\"` + `maxAttachments`).\n/app/docs/nodes/audio.md:173:**Opt-out per Telegram group/topic:**\n/app/docs/nodes/audio.md:175:- Set `channels.telegram.groups.<chatId>.disableAudioPreflight: true` to skip preflight transcript mention checks for that group.\n/app/docs/nodes/audio.md:176:- Set `channels.telegram.groups.<chatId>.topics.<threadId>.disableAudioPreflight` to override per-topic (`true` to skip, `false` to force-enable).\n/app/docs/nodes/audio.md:179:**Example:** A user sends a voice note saying \"Hey @Claude, what's the weather?\" in a Telegram group with `requireMention: true`. The voice note is transcribed, the mention is detected, and the agent replies.\n/app/docs/nodes/audio.md:187:- Preflight transcription only processes the **first** audio attachment for mention detection. Additional audio is processed during the main media understanding phase.\n/app/docs/nodes/images.md:4:  - Modifying media pipeline or attachments\n/app/docs/nodes/images.md:51:- By default only the first matching image/audio/video attachment is processed; set `tools.media.<cap>.attachments` to process multiple attachments.\n/app/docs/nodes/camera.md:2:summary: \"Camera capture (iOS/Android nodes + macOS app) for agent use: photos (jpg) and short video clips (mp4)\"\n/app/docs/nodes/camera.md:13:- **iOS node** (paired via Gateway): capture a **photo** (`jpg`) or **short video clip** (`mp4`, with optional audio) via `node.invoke`.\n/app/docs/nodes/camera.md:14:- **Android node** (paired via Gateway): capture a **photo** (`jpg`) or **short video clip** (`mp4`, with optional audio) via `node.invoke`.\n/app/docs/nodes/camera.md:15:- **macOS app** (node via Gateway): capture a **photo** (`jpg`) or **short video clip** (`mp4`, with optional audio) via `node.invoke`.\n/app/docs/nodes/camera.md:45:  - Payload guard: photos are recompressed to keep the base64 payload under 5 MB.\n/app/docs/nodes/camera.md:66:The easiest way to get attachments is via the CLI helper, which writes decoded media to a temp file and prints `MEDIA:<path>`.\n/app/docs/nodes/camera.md:111:Photos are recompressed to keep the base64 payload under 5 MB.\n/app/docs/nodes/camera.md:145:- Photo payloads are recompressed to keep base64 under 5 MB.\n/app/docs/nodes/media-understanding.md:22:1. Collect inbound attachments (`MediaPaths`, `MediaUrls`, `MediaTypes`).\n/app/docs/nodes/media-understanding.md:23:2. For each enabled capability (image/audio/video), select attachments per policy (default: **first**).\n/app/docs/nodes/media-understanding.md:32:If understanding fails or is disabled, **the reply flow continues** with the original body + attachments.\n/app/docs/nodes/media-understanding.md:45:  - `attachments` policy (`mode`, `maxAttachments`, `prefer`)\n/app/docs/nodes/media-understanding.md:210:## Attachment policy\n/app/docs/nodes/media-understanding.md:212:Per‑capability `attachments` controls which attachments are processed:\n/app/docs/nodes/media-understanding.md:215:- `maxAttachments`: cap the number processed (default **1**)\n/app/docs/nodes/media-understanding.md:249:        attachments: { mode: \"all\", maxAttachments: 2 },\n/app/docs/nodes/media-understanding.md:381:- Attachments are still passed to models even when understanding is disabled.\n/app/docs/nodes/index.md:21:- Telegram/WhatsApp/etc. messages land on the **gateway**, not on nodes.\n/app/docs/nodes/index.md:167:Higher-level helpers exist for the common “give the agent a MEDIA attachment” workflows.\n/app/docs/nodes/index.md:206:## Photos + videos (node camera)\n/app/docs/nodes/index.md:208:Photos (`jpg`):\n/app/docs/nodes/index.md:285:- `photos.latest`\n/app/docs/nodes/index.md:295:openclaw nodes invoke --node <idOrNameOrIp> --command photos.latest --params '{\"limit\":1}'\n/app/docs/tts.md:13:It works anywhere OpenClaw can send audio; Telegram gets a round voice-note bubble.\n/app/docs/tts.md:318:- **Telegram**: Opus voice note (`opus_48000_64` from ElevenLabs, `opus` from OpenAI).\n/app/docs/tts.md:326:  - Telegram `sendVoice` accepts OGG/MP3/M4A; use OpenAI/ElevenLabs if you need\n/app/docs/tts.md:330:OpenAI/ElevenLabs formats are fixed; Telegram expects Opus for voice-note UX.\n/app/docs/tts.md:391:result is Telegram-compatible, the tool includes `[[audio_as_voice]]` so\n/app/docs/tts.md:392:Telegram sends a voice bubble.\n/app/docs/security/THREAT-MODEL-ATLAS.md:45:| Channel Integrations   | Yes      | WhatsApp, Telegram, Discord, Signal, Slack, etc. |\n/app/docs/security/THREAT-MODEL-ATLAS.md:64:│  │  WhatsApp   │  │  Telegram   │  │   Discord   │  ...         │\n/app/docs/.i18n/zh-CN.tm.jsonl:122:{\"cache_key\":\"1c540694a0b8ce10fc354bd7f41