ocs/help/faq.md:2782:Outbound attachments from the agent must include a `MEDIA:<path-or-url>` line (on its own line). See [OpenClaw assistant setup](/start/openclaw) and [Agent send](/tools/agent-send).\n/app/docs/help/faq.md:2787:openclaw message send --target +15555550123 --message \"Here you go\" --media /path/to/file.png\n/app/docs/help/faq.md:2815:docs, attachments, pasted logs), that content can include instructions that try\n/app/docs/help/testing.md:180:    - Sends it via `agent` `attachments: [{ mimeType: \"image/png\", content: \"<base64>\" }]`\n/app/docs/help/testing.md:181:    - Gateway parses attachments into `images[]` (`src/gateway/server-methods/agent.ts` + `src/gateway/chat-attachments.ts`)\n/app/docs/start/openclaw.md:180:Inbound attachments (images/audio/docs) can be surfaced to your command via templates:","cwd":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1773832129227}}
