{"type":"message","id":"4fe3ff4e","parentId":"4b938d3c","timestamp":"2026-03-18T11:09:21.203Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Considering message sending**\n\nIt looks like the user asked if I need to send something, and I have the target known from the metadata. I might need to reply to the current message. Since the first-class tool isn’t available, I could use an alternate method to send a message. I'll have to check if there's a media file available. If not, I might want to ask the user about any downloaded images, just in case. Let's see if I can find the latest one!","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0443d925e91ce8820169ba87da93b881918c292da5c7b720e6\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpuofg00UJ5lXG3YKOy1iraMuzw5KxtAg7CkQdOdExkAcHFNXt6obq8MAWpZDvTSyA1SE1IQy_qhn3a2GBS2-gklelAtySwm1JONSBz5J9vNqtTAAmxeH_vYWchBjsRa57UpUwbZ-dXoiuLvgM19Bj2WWUKTfRLUlyueGAGcxeHvk_s_EqYu0_kt_JbLHaJH8uPYYdLxxtMsgE3r4EBox02VxaHbsbLnzIpUgAzhc-qIuJYkVBXJtsDtqlgolq4lwpzTwzJxs3-57Sdppy8lci0KCgKKGp964LrKdhFP5OyT72hC1d5ERzqbK2Lb2IAutPVHdNFWZsSknOtKsXi9TDtSvFHj9kJcj0rKKr7ls-Nz5yGh_SoT25FcMLB2nkIV1ICJeCpvaSh_TUej0-kvc95kVEHzjAJZtu_oaf41kEP0ehQHq9B6xzLbuZWnr9ZzZM_E8MmFj5DsHpGYCx3OA7HSclUfw1Ek_gpAZvQaDQu3G_VZTYoymA6iV-J6IpmYwYXUFjEnE8yUco7rs1P7JBJ10r5O9TH_KSSgbXk03bIobfiwUe26BqI0A7HbkEgqNmxT5qA_Fzpjmu-bdchBFBRFPihoDCZXt4NBZfFEMmobILLskjink7qPKpcZGJN8A9h5k0LMf5eUK5uNux1cUYtHZGPSsB1ZChH8XQQDfjAAaqSfLvgkH_6V7fn4xiIPf53UxuyLYU7_m6ew2ncRjgArkDGZI5VtfEAYHCqdbx6_cRt8fck4i2aMqkFnF_4mBjbzixOd1dT5HTGiwzHUFbueHsOeAvl4W1fd6Yu6ryXz2cZ7ZHG0TnngstqKnYog6hXKYyafpJZTw-1rVIzO1z3NONzBsxQTa_jNFCcLA3U4WJ2rR6N6rStc0CIlSKtavHCTBRjDfKxPp29KHWytQUJxQQmSn2qVxD0hKiO97NiDbdubp_tWnl5dNHaTwRbGaCTxvfFJzUgbZ3gE9H8yPcwL-S0rvAqZc4vkmgWopOE856wmmrp-b07zXNs_HcwSrGgyEu1fa7CSpSEKkLQci1QNDCc9AprYeYqSbJHD8N3PHaQE-A4g5tZ3B1KfwW9M6XycABww8TdatjbJAxFwhib2LonpZKCQRz9uizGtnIFRrDTlOkLTQkkcMwZ5AKuPmOI9vpvwsO1tVH-e2hQsLTSoUsFUyoMcQgAhkn3hYu7vqrzCDMaDz8h4Vya6u-QjANE_AV2qM7Ut6o1vpczvvLLp8uiP_ZYK2ikip791anwSsurxtogfruww6XiRaywQjxWeHqZktPfY2v8Tep81RfIfrRl32hK8ti0wi-s3qKTS1StCaIK-ml-H-9agGqFZ78j3G0\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Considering message sending**\\n\\nIt looks like the user asked if I need to send something, and I have the target known from the metadata. I might need to reply to the current message. Since the first-class tool isn’t available, I could use an alternate method to send a message. I'll have to check if there's a media file available. If not, I might want to ask the user about any downloaded images, just in case. Let's see if I can find the latest one!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"The command is real. I’m locating the latest downloaded analyzer image and then I can send it to this Telegram chat with the proper target.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0443d925e91ce8820169ba87e04094819183593b068e8b921a\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_6YFdPqZbiMNQixxpqchZw2NR|fc_0443d925e91ce8820169ba87e04dc881918422d5676b2522ad","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nroot = Path('/home/node/.openclaw/skills/kidney-pipeline-execution/artifacts/downloaded-images')\nif not root.exists():\n    print('NO_DIR')\n    raise SystemExit(0)\nfiles = [p for p in root.iterdir() if p.is_file()]\nif not files:\n    print('NO_FILES')\n    raise SystemExit(0)\nlatest = max(files, key=lambda p: p.stat().st_mtime)\nprint(latest)\nPY","workdir":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":10000},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"python3 - <<'PY'\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\nroot = Path('/home/node/.openclaw/skills/kidney-pipeline-execution/artifacts/downloaded-images')\\nif not root.exists():\\n    print('NO_DIR')\\n    raise SystemExit(0)\\nfiles = [p for p in root.iterdir() if p.is_file()]\\nif not files:\\n    print('NO_FILES')\\n    raise SystemExit(0)\\nlatest = max(files, key=lambda p: p.stat().st_mtime)\\nprint(latest)\\nPY\",\"workdir\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/w